  "notes": [
    "Initial client/instrumentation patches are diffs against 5f4b4b4; their shared bounded core is retained in final-src_simulator.rs. Integrated/final patches are against 30064ec and also include the core changes.",
    "The initial 5f4b4b4 baseline used the same harness before rustfmt; its original byte hash was not retained. Both integrated-main variants use the exact archived formatted harness bytes.",
    "The capacity helper uses exact public spawn_margin; that API retains exhaustive arithmetic in all variants.",
    "Stored profile bodyLength values are continuous segment mass, relabeled storedLengthSegments in selected results; capacity polylineLength is world units.",
    "Host runs include instrumentation and shared desktop scheduling. Hashes identify artifacts, not performance or capacity guarantees."
  ]
